    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.28896_p13_b13",
      "text": "3. CKA: Minimum CKA(hb, h\u2206) \u22480.05 at layer 18, the key semantic processing layer.\n",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        580.8,
        489.75,
