    {
      "block_id": "2605.28896_p13_b16",
      "text": "Our findings imply a concrete safety concern: interpretability tools trained on base model\nactivations may be systematically blind to adapter contributions. If an organisation deploys a\n",
      "bbox": [
        71.16,
        706.21,
        523.33,
        730.77
